d derivatives; to use cellular standard-essential patents, including 3G, 4G and 5G for cellular devices. The QSI segment invests in early-stage companies in various industries, including 5G, artificial intelligence, automotive, consumer, enterprise, cloud, IoT, and extended reality, and investments, including non-marketable equity securities and, to a lesser extent, marketable equity securities, and convertible debt instruments. It also provides development, and other services and sells related products to the United States government agencies and their contractors. In addition, the company is also involved in Qualcomm government technologies and data center businesses. Further, it provides security and intelligence services for unmanaged networks through software-based network security solutions. The company is in collaboration with Amazon to enable customized silicon at scale for large-scale AI data centers. QUALCOMM Incorporated was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in San Diego, California.","employees":52000,"website":"https://www.qualcomm.com","country":"United States","city":"San Diego","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Cristiano Renno Amon","title":"CEO, President & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Akash  Palkhiwala","title":"Executive VP, CFO & COO"},{"name":"Ms. Ann N. Cathcart Chaplin","title":"Executive VP, General Counsel & Corporate Secretary"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":16.61,"tpe":28.37,"ps":4.322,"pfcf":24.86,"peg":1.14,"pb":4.298,"ev_ebitda":18.07,"rev_growth":0.179,"eps_growth":0.3785,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2364,"eps_growth_next":0.1867,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1242,"roa":0.0481,"de":31.49,"gross_margin":0.5305,"op_margin":0.1226,"profit_margin":0.09004,"current_ratio":1.835},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":12.21,"sector":16.61,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":12.35,"sector":28.37,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.798,"sector":4.322,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF"